  "content": "<h4>FTB Utilities 是 LatvianModder 制作的一款模组。它旨在为 FTB 平台提供多种实用工具，包括区块认领、自动关闭 TPA 等功能。</h4>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h2>从 <strong>5.3.0.83</strong> 版本开始，备份功能已移至 <a href=\"https://minecraft.curseforge.com/projects/ftb-utilities-backups\" rel=\"nofollow\">FTB Utilities: Backups</a>！其他部分也将陆续迁移。</h2>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>1.7.10 视频教程由 Rajecent 制作：&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=QXARc2E4Jj8\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=QXARc2E4Jj8</a></p>\n<p><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/QXARc2E4Jj8?wmode=transparent\" width=\"638\" height=\"358\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>视频教程由 <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCgn6pPd9xcGtmWiVPfIfjKw\" rel=\"nofollow\">MegaPunch Q</a> 制作：&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=p7gmuAa2sYo\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=p7gmuAa2sYo</a></p>\n<p><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/p7gmuAa2sYo?wmode=transparent\" width=\"638\" height=\"358\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p>",
